00:00:03.443 --> 00:00:04.324
and all the kids start singing

00:00:04.324 --> 00:00:05.157
- Oh yeah,

00:00:05.157 --> 00:00:05.990
that really happened.
- The theme song.

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:07.640
Has that ever happened to you?

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.160
