00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.360
my dad and my step-mom were in New York,

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.120
and we went to a really fancy restaurant.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.140
There was a pianist, and a harpist,

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.303
