00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.000
Well suddenly a pianist, and a harp,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.440
and a violinist started
playing Heart and Soul.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.390
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.300
- I said, I think this
is because of the movie.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.090
- Do you get embarrassed
in that situation,

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:32.990
or so you think it's cool?

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:34.160
- It's better than the other stuff

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.220
